## 1. Main Parameters I
2 {n_total_elements} {n_total_nodes} 0 {num_symmetric_planes} 2 2 {bem_type} 0
##
## 2. Main Parameters II
{n_planewaves} {n_pointsources} {is_internal} 0.0000e+00 0 0 0
# NumCalc reads five fields here (NC_Input.cpp:294-298); the trailing two are
# ignored. 4th = ClusEdgL0, the FMM initial bounding-box edge length in m:
# 0 means NumCalc's default of (sqrt(N)*A0)^0.5. Shrinking it gives smaller
# cluster radii, a shorter multipole expansion L, and lower peak memory --
# the documented remedy when a large mesh exhausts RAM or L exceeds ~30
# (arXiv:2312.00005 Sec. 3.3.2, 4.2). Try e.g. 0.05 in that case.
# 5th = IPRECOND in [-3,2]: 0 none, negative selects incomplete-LU depth.
##
## 3. Main Parameters III
0 0 0 0
##
## 4. Main Parameters IV
{speed_of_sound:.1f} {air_density:.4e} {time_factor} 0.0e+00 0.0e+00 0.0e+00 0.0e+00
##
